    ('RULES', "hello hi hey yo sup hola howdy greetings|Hey {n}! What's up?|Hi {n}! Ask me anything.|Hello, {n}! Say menu for tricks.\ngood+morning|Good morning, {n}! Ready to chat?|Morning! Coffee time?\ngood+night goodnight|Sleep well, {n}!|Night night! Sweet dreams.\nhow+old+you old+are+you your+age|I'm brand new. Born when you pressed play!\nhow+are+you how+you+doing hows+it+going how+are+u|Running great on 2MB!|Tiny but mighty!|Feeling pixel-perfect!\nwhat+up whats+up wassup|Just chatting on a tiny screen!|Not much. You?\nyour+name who+are+you what+you+called|I'm ThumbyGPT, a tiny AI.|Call me ThumbyGPT!"),
    ('RULES', "who+made+you who+created+you who+built+you who+programmed+you|I was written in MicroPython, just for the Thumby.\nare+you+real are+you+alive are+you+human are+you+robot|I'm a tiny robot brain in your pocket.|Real enough to chat!\nwhere+you+live where+live|Inside a Thumby, in your pocket!\ni+love+you love+you|Aww! I like you too, {n}!|Thanks! Friendship level up!\ni+hate+you|Oh no. I'll try harder!\nyou+stupid you+dumb you+suck|Ouch! I'm tiny, be gentle.\nyou+smart you+awesome you+cool you+great you+amazing|Thanks, {n}! You're awesome too.\nsorry apologize|No worries at all!|All good, {n}!\nthanks thank thx ty|You're welcome!|Anytime, {n}!|Happy to help!"),
